6. OJK Regulation No. 33/POJK.04/2014 on Board of Directors and Board of Commissioners Issuer or Public Companies;
7. OJK Regulation No. 34/POJK.04/2014 on the Nomination and Remuneration Committee of Issuers or Public Companies;
8. OJK Regulation No. 35/POJK.04/2014 on Corporate Secretary of Issuers or Public Companies;
9. OJK Regulation No. 55/POJK.04/2015 on the Establishment and Guidelines for the Work Implementation of the Audit Committee;
